Package: scx-loader
Architecture: any
Depends:
 dbus,
 polkitd | policykit-1,
 systemd | init-system-helpers,
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: D-Bus scheduler loader for sched_ext
 scx_loader is a system daemon that starts and switches sched_ext schedulers
 through a polkit-authorized D-Bus interface. The package also provides the
 scxctl command-line client and the service, interface, and policy files.
